BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_H0::
	.string "Those ladies, the way they\n"
	.string "bad-mouth each other, you probably\l"
	.string "think that they don't get along.\p"
	.string "But if that were true, they wouldn't\n"
	.string "stay out here together, would they?$"

BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_H1::
	.string "Buhahaha!\p"
	.string "You couldn't tell it from looking\n"
	.string "now, but I used to be one tough\l"
	.string "TRAINER.\p"
	.string "I had a reputation as the toughest\n"
	.string "BEAUTY around, I tell you!\p"
	.string "… … … … … …\p"
	.string "What is it now?\n"
	.string "You don't believe me.\p"
	.string "I'm not like that blowhard woman\n"
	.string "over there. I'm actually talented!\p"
	.string "Let me prove it to you. I can teach\n"
	.string "your POKéMON special and yet cute\l"
	.string "moves.\p"
	.string "But my lessons don't come free. How\n"
	.string "about paying for the moves I teach\l"
	.string "with a wee bit of Battle Points?$"

BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_H2::
	.string "Ihihihi!\p"
	.string "I know it's hard to see now, but I\n"
	.string "used to be one fantastic TRAINER.\p"
	.string "I had a reputation as the most\n"
	.string "invincible SWIMMER around, I tell\l"
	.string "you!\p"
	.string "… … … … … …\p"
	.string "What's wrong?\n"
	.string "You don't believe me.\p"
	.string "I'm not like that buffoonish woman\n"
	.string "over there. I'm actually\l"
	.string "experienced!\p"
	.string "I can prove it to you.\n"
	.string "I can teach your POKéMON hard and\l"
	.string "yet pretty moves.\p"
	.string "But my lessons don't come free. How\n"
	.string "about paying for the moves I teach\l"
	.string "with a wee bit of Battle Points?$"

BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_H3::
	.string "When I was just a wee YOUNGSTER,\n"
	.string "those ladies were strong and\l"
	.string "beautiful.\p"
	.string "They were idols among us TRAINERS.\p"
	.string "Even now, age hasn't dulled their\n"
	.string "abilities.\p"
	.string "In fact, their POKéMON moves have\n"
	.string "grown even more polished.\p"
	.string "But… For some reason, I can't help\n"
	.string "but feel this…\p"
	.string "Time is so cruel…$"

